# Function SetSwapInterval

Language: 
> Function SetSwapInterval

Sets the swap interval for vertical synchronization (VSync).

>> Syntax

SetSwapInterval(value:Int)

>> Description

Use this function to enable or disable vertical synchronization (VSync). When the value is 0, VSync is disabled (allowing uncapped frame rate); when the value is 1, VSync is enabled (syncs to display refresh rate).

This is useful for controlling frame rate and reducing screen tearing in your game.

>> Example

<pre>
Method OnCreate:Int()
	SetUpdateRate(60)
	SetSwapInterval(1) ' Enable VSync
	Return 0
End
</pre>

>> See also

[[SetUpdateRate]]

